#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2247A expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "Pins the exact semantics of is_complete_date_part, which judges ONLY the leading YYYY-MM-DD portion. A truncated TIME is therefore NOT this rule's business - the sheet asks for 'at least full date'."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSPARM   type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 1 | SSTDTC | Study Start Date | 2020-01-15T10:30
